nodes.body:
@tjtanaa The changes I made in this PR only prevent `rocm_attn` and `triton_attn` from crashing due to the deallocation error. The same pattern is already implemented in `flash_attn`, which I believe was missed when `rocm_attn` and `triton_attn` were originally written.

Because of this, I don't think an accuracy test would make sense for this PR. Also, The current Accuracy tests don't support Cascade , I would need to write a separate accuracy test for Cascade.

I'm happy to add that test if it's necessary to verify this behavior before merging the PR.

